    "When on, finishing an episode auto-plays the next item from the Queue. When off, episode end still marks played / saves progress but does not advance. End-of-episode sleep timer always stops without advancing. Default on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, finishing an episode auto-plays the next item from the Queue. When off, episode end still marks played / saves progress but does not advance. End-of-episode sleep timer always stops without advancing. Default on."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn aktiv, startet nach Ende einer Episode automatisch die nächste aus der Warteschlange. Wenn aus, wird die Episode weiterhin als gehört markiert / Fortschritt gespeichert, aber nicht weitergeschaltet. Der Sleep-Timer „Ende der Episode“ stoppt weiterhin ohne Weiterleitung. Standard an."
          }
        }
      }
    }
